classDiagram
    class CameraRouter {
        +upload_calibration(id: int, file: UploadFile) Dict
    }
    class CameraService {
        +update_calibration(db, camera_id, file) Camera
        +validate_calibration_json(data: dict) bool
    }
    class MinIOService {
        +upload_file(bucket, object_name, data) str
    }
    class Camera {
        +id: int
        +has_calibration: bool
        +calibration_path: str
    }
    CameraRouter --> CameraService : Parse JSON
    CameraService --> MinIOService : Lưu S3 Bucket
    CameraService --> Camera : Đánh dấu has_calib
